# Unicode CLDR 47, locale ga, gregorian calendar (cldr-json
# cldr-dates-full/main/ga/ca-gregorian.json).
# The month name stands bare, follows the noun "mí" in the
# genitive ("mí Aibreáin"), or follows the bare preposition "i"
# eclipsed ("i mBealtaine").  Declension: en.wiktionary.org, the
# headword's own table; eclipsis: its own mutation table.
Samhain
Samhna
mí Samhna
Samh
